flies  \n• Farm Fuzzy Bombs  \n• Farm Leaves  \n• Farm Mythic Meteor Showers (Premium)  \n• Farm Puppy Ball (Premium)  \n• Farm Showers  \n• Farm Sprouts  \n• Farm Under Balloons (Premium)  \n• Farm Under Clouds  \n• Farm in Field when Full  \n\n• Follow Player  \n\n• Hive Management  \n• Hive Name Customization  \n\n• Ignore Honey Token  \n• Ignored Tokens  \n• Item Management  \n\n• Local Player Tween Speed  \n• Local Player Walkspeed  \n\n• Maintain Puffshroom Blessing  \n• Movement Method  \n\n• Planter Management  \n\n• Priority Tokens  \n• Puffshroom Level Controls  \n\n• Server Hop  \n• Server Hop Event Selector  \n• Server Hop Delay  \n\n• Shops Teleports  \n• Stickers Tab  \n• Teleports (Fields)  \n• Teleports (NPCs)  \n• Teleports (Toys)  \n\n• Tier Priority (Badges)  \n• Token Handling  \n\n• UI Customization  \n• UI Responsiveness and Layout  \n\n• Webhook Integrations  \n• Walkspeed Control  \n\nMacroware is updated regularly to stay aligned with Bee Swarm Simulator changes. The script is built with a safety-first mindset and avoids unsafe behavior whenever possible. It is meant for long-term use rather than quick risky farming.\n\nFull documentation and setup guides can be found here:\nhttps://docs.macroware.cc","tags":["bee swarm simulator","bee swarm script","bee swarm simulator script","macro v bee swarm simulator","macro v"],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://macroware.cc/loader.lua\"))()","owner":{"_id":"6591b72bf88db32497debb8a","username":"salesmacrov3","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/user-default.webp","status":"offline","id":"6591b72bf88db32497debb8a","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000}},"verified":true,"keyLink":"","views":625459,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","createdAt":"2024-01-24T06:10:03.493Z","dislikeCount":5,"likeCount":15,"image":"/images/sb/1537690962-1706076603464.webp","editBy":{"_id":"6591b72bf88db32497debb8a","username":"salesmacrov3","statu